dmabuf-import (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rename: source and binary package udmabuf-import(-dkms) -> dmabuf-import(-dkms).
  * Module udmabuf_import -> dmabuf_import; device node /dev/dmabuf_import.
  * ioctls renamed DMABUF_IMPORT_ATTACH / _DETACH / _GET_MAP and structs
    dmabuf_import_{attach,dma_map,get_map}; magic and numbers unchanged.
  * UAPI header now installs as /usr/include/linux/dmabuf_import.h.
  * Drop the coexistence guard against a patched <linux/udmabuf.h>; it only
    mattered for the patched-kernel delivery this module replaced.
  * Ship an example udev rule in the docdir for optional group access.

 -- Simon A. F. Lund <os@safl.dk>  Tue, 11 Aug 2026 10:00:00 +0200

udmabuf-import (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial DKMS packaging of the out-of-tree udmabuf dma-buf importer.

